---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Edwin — Home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="availability-badge">
        <span class="availability-dot"></span>
        Open to New Projects and Collaborations
      </div>
      <h1>Edwin Tieu</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Embedded Software Engineer building resilient defense systems - <br />
        from Inertial Navigation Systems to Acoustic Localization Networks.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/EdwinTieu5642" class="hero-link" aria-label="GitHub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.65.5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.11.79-.25.79-.56v-2c-3.2.69-3.87-1.36-3.87-1.36-.52-1.32-1.28-1.67-1.28-1.67-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.71 1.26 3.37.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.56-.29-5.25-1.28-5.25-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.29 1.19-3.1-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.18 1.18a11 11 0 0 1 5.79 0c2.2-1.49 3.18-1.18 3.18-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.84 1.19 3.1 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.26 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14v3.17c0 .31.21.68.8.56C20.71 21.39 24 17.08 24 12 24 5.65 18.85.5 12 .5Z" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/edwin-tieu-2abbd/" class="hero-link" aria-label="LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.56c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.86-3.04-1.86 0-2.15 1.45-2.15 2.95v5.65H9.34V9h3.4v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.86 3.35-1.86 3.59 0 4.25 2.36 4.25 5.43v6.32ZM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12ZM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45ZM22.23 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.46C23.21 24 24 23.23 24 22.27V1.73C24 .77 23.21 0 22.23 0Z" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:edwindysontieu@gmail.com" class="hero-link" aria-label="Email">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2" />
            <path d="m2 7 10 6 10-6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about" id="about">
    <h2 class="about-title">About Me</h2>
    <div class="intro">
      <img src="/edwin.jpg" alt="Edwin Tieu" class="intro-photo" />
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>
          I'm an Embedded Software Engineer passionate about solving hard problems at the intersection of AI and Defense. I earned both my B.S. in Computer Science and Computer Engineering and my M.S. in Computer Engineering from USC.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm driven by building systems that have real-world impact, especially technologies that can help protect and save lives. My goal is to continuously grow by taking on challenging problems and pushing myself to learn as quickly as possible.
        </p>
        <p>
          In my free time, I like to work on developing iOS Applications, learn more about Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence systems, and ideate new and exciting projects to work on next.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-value">1</span>
        <span class="stat-label">iOS App Shipped</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-value">3</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Research Projects</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-value">3</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Internships Worked</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-value">∞</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Curiosity</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="projects" id="projects">
    <h2 class="projects-title">Projects</h2>
    <p class="projects-subtitle">Examples of my work in embedded systems and software engineering.</p>
    <div class="projects-grid">
      <a class="project-card" href="https://www.guides-maker.com/archiwalk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="project-card-header">
          <svg class="project-icon" style="width:17px;height:17px;" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.152 6.896c-.948 0-2.415-1.078-3.96-1.04-2.04.027-3.91 1.183-4.961 3.014-2.117 3.675-.546 9.103 1.519 12.09 1.013 1.459 2.208 3.09 3.792 3.029 1.52-.065 2.09-.987 3.935-.987 1.831 0 2.35.987 3.96.948 1.637-.026 2.676-1.48 3.676-2.948 1.156-1.688 1.636-3.325 1.662-3.415-.039-.013-3.182-1.221-3.22-4.857-.026-3.04 2.48-4.494 2.597-4.559-1.429-2.09-3.623-2.324-4.39-2.376-2-.156-3.675 1.09-4.61 1.09zM15.53 3.83c.843-1.012 1.4-2.427 1.245-3.83-1.207.052-2.662.805-3.532 1.818-.78.896-1.454 2.338-1.273 3.714 1.338.104 2.715-.688 3.559-1.701"/></svg>
          <h3>ArchiWalk iOS App</h3>
        </div>
        <p>An architectural tour app that brings buildings to life through guided experiences. It uses Generative AI platforms to make tours more accessible to the general public.</p>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span class="tag">Swift</span>
          <span class="tag">Python</span>
          <span class="tag">Figma</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-card-header">
          <svg class="project-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"/><path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14"/></svg>
          <h3>Acoustic Localization in IoBT</h3>
        </div>
        <p>DoD-commissioned research in partnership with USC to develop low-cost, interconnected sensor networks capable of detecting and classifying audio sources on the battlefield.</p>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span class="tag">ROS</span>
          <span class="tag">Python</span>
          <span class="tag">Linux</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-card-header">
          <svg class="project-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 11V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2"/><path d="M14 10V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"/><path d="M10 10.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8"/><path d="M18 11a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v3a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-2c-2.8 0-4.5-.86-5.99-2.34l-3.6-3.6a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.82L7 15"/></svg>
          <h3>3D4E Freehand Group</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Led a team of 8 engineers in partnership with Children's Hospital Los Angeles (CHLA) to design and fabricate 3D-printed prosthetics for pediatric patients with limb differences.</p>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span class="tag">CAD</span>
          <span class="tag">Leadership</span>
          <span class="tag">Blender</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="find-me">
    <h2>Find Me</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/EdwinTieu5642" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/edwin-tieu-2abbd/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href="mailto:edwindysontieu@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
